{"id":"n64358-3-5","stage":1,"title":"까맣다 · 一干二净","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64358-3-5-1","ko":"유민아, 내일 시험 있는 거 알아?","zh":"裕敏啊，你知道明天有考试吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"시험","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아","audio":"/audio/afb5239ccd10c522dc68.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3a6e9e4fe2a783db5a91.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64358-3-5-2","ko":"난 까맣게 모르고 있었는데, 시험 범위가 어디야?","zh":"我完全不知道呢，考试的范围是哪些内容啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"까맣게","meaning":"一干二净，全然","explanation":"까맣다：一干二净，全然；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"까맣다","audio":"/audio/bc133da98e99a2281b43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64358","senseId":"3","lemma":"까맣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"까맣게","audio":"/audio/5e9da070d2305841e32d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르고","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르고","audio":"/audio/09573e86c49a1672dd34.mp3"}},{"text":"있었는데,","meaning":"一直处于某种状态（모르고 있다：一直不知道）","explanation":"있다：一直处于某种状态（모르고 있다：一直不知道）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었는데","audio":"/audio/2d342a4ef128538b404b.mp3"}},{"text":"시험","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}},{"text":"범위가","meaning":"范围","explanation":"범위：范围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"범위","audio":"/audio/2281025b69a422c01adf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14454","senseId":"1","lemma":"범위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"범위가","audio":"/audio/9a208cc1ba26c3b57d96.mp3"}},{"text":"어디야?","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디야","audio":"/audio/3d238c840b300c329bff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"bc133da98e99a228","term":"까맣다","zh":"一干二净，全然","audio":"/audio/bc133da98e99a2281b43.mp3","entryId":"64358","definition":"完全没有记忆或完全不知道。","pronunciation":["까ː마타"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"一直处于某种状态（모르고 있다：一直不知道）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"一直处于某种状态（모르고 있다：一直不知道）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"2281025b69a422c0","term":"범위","zh":"范围","audio":"/audio/2281025b69a422c01adf.mp3","entryId":"14454","definition":"限定的一定区域；或指某种力量到达的极限。","pronunciation":["버ː뮈"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]}],"audio":"/audio/17011a9547a033c046cd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.79,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64358","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4434,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["裕敏啊，你知道明天有考试吗？","我完全不知道呢，考试的范围是哪些内容啊？","在同学聚会上没能好好和你聊聊，就要分开啦，真有点遗憾。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏啊，你知道明天有考试吗？","我完全不知道呢，考试的范围是哪些内容啊？","在同学聚会上没能好好和你聊聊，就要分开啦，真有点遗憾。"],"answer":1}]}
